## User

The sum of the decimal digits of a non-negative integer.

## Type

type
```haskell
sumDigits :: Int -> Int
```

## Term

```haskell
sumDigits = go 0
  where
    go :: Int -> Int -> Int
    go acc 0 = acc
    go acc n = go (acc + n) (n `div` 10)
```

